    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRANS WORLD SERVICE\nMADRID\n3770K",
      "Welcome Shoard\nTo Start\nOn Transcontinental Flights, We Offer a Selection\nof Hors d'Oeuvre at Cocktail Time.\nSalad\nOn Flights West, We Feature Athenian Salad with Fresh\nGarden Greens, Greek Olives, Feta Cheese and Tomato\nWedge. Oil and Vinegar Dressing.\nOn Eastbound Flights, Crisp Greens and Colorful Vegetables\nare Served with Our Dressing of the Day.\nDesserts\nINTERNATIONAL CHEESE AND CRACKERS\nFROM THE PATISSERIE\nFor Westward Travelers; Our German Chocolate Tart\nwith Pecans and Coconut in a Pastry Crust.\nPassengers Flying East Will Enjoy Our Zabaglione Trifle\nwith a Marsala Flavored Custard.\nEntree Selections\nBRISKET OF BEEF KENSINGTON\nChoice Beef Slices in a Mellow English-Style Horseradish\nCream Sauce. Parslied Potatoes, Peas and Carrot Slices.\nCHICKEN NORMANDY\nBoneless Breast of Chicken Baked in Pan Gravy with\nApple Cider. Green Beans and a White, Wild Rice Blend\nTrans World Specialties\nWe Have the Enviable Opportunity to Discover Cuisines\nfrom Around the World, and You Are Invited to Share\nSome of Our All Time Favorites. Your Flight Attendant\nWill Advise You of Today's Selection.\nLASAGNA VERDI AL FORNO BOLOGNESE\nSauce Bolognese, Ricotta Cheese and Ground Italian\nSausage Nested between Layers of Spinach Noodles.\nFISH AND CHIPS\nA British Favorite.\nServed with Malt Vinegar Flavored Tartar Sauce.\nBAVARIAN WURST PLATTER\nCOFFEE FLAVORS OF THE WORLD at $1.50 Each\nThe Perfect Touch of Hot Coffee and Whipped\nCream, It's the Spirit that Makes the Difference!\nJamaican with Kahlua\nRoyale with Cognac\nRoma with Galliano\nGrilled Bratwurst and Knockwurst with a Mustard Glaze.\nHot German Potato Salad and Weinkraut.\nTHAI BEEF CURRY\nTidbits of Choice Beef in a Curry Sauce with Coconut Juice,\nTomato Bits, Mango Chutney and Strips of Red Ginger.\nPlease accept our apologies if your choice is not available on today's flight.\nD-95\n15"
    ],
